{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_102_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_102_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27658f1a18db213f38b702fc011d38c76240193521faadbb1a1e3b5d0a353c57", "ja": "千早、ブログを書いてくれてありがとう。\nものすごい数の感想が届いてたな！", "zh": "千早，谢谢你写了博客。\n收到了好多好多感想啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
